      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "summary",
          "text": "Red Hat OpenShift Service Mesh 2.4.5 Containers\n\nRed Hat Product Security has rated this update as having a security impact of Moderate. A Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE link(s) in the References section.",
          "title": "Topic"
        },
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Red Hat OpenShift Service Mesh is Red Hat's distribution of the Istio service mesh project, tailored for installation into an OpenShift Container Platform installation.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* openshift-istio-cni-rhel8-container: golang.org/x/net/html: Cross site scripting (CVE-2023-3978)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
          "title": "Details"
        },
